# =============================================================================
# Required env vars — set via Doppler or .env.local
# =============================================================================
# DATABASE_URL          PostgreSQL connection string (Neon/serverless)
# BETTER_AUTH_URL       Deployment URL (e.g. http://localhost:3000)
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET    Auth signing secret — generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`
# ENCRYPTION_KEY        Key for encrypting user secrets — generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`
#
# OAuth providers (optional — disable by leaving unset):
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID / GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
#
# Cron job auth (optional — one of these is required for /api/cron):
# CRON_SECRET           Bearer token for cron job authentication
# CRON_TOKEN            Alternative token via x-cron-token header
#
# Sentry (optional):
# SENTRY_DSN / NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN
# SENTRY_ORG / SENTRY_PROJECT / SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN
# =============================================================================

# Users configure their LLM provider, API keys, and Slack webhooks
# through the application settings UI. No env vars needed for those.
